  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2015/01/IMG_0207.jpg\" style=\"height: 320px; width: 480px\" /></p>\n<p>El madrile&ntilde;o Edu Manazas ha llenado con su guitarra el&eacute;ctrica y su potente voz, al final incluso sin micr&oacute;fono,&nbsp;la tarde-noche de este viernes de blues infernal los dos locales de La Oveja Negra en Onda.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/bluesedumanazaslaovejanegra/img_0171.jpg\" alt=\"img_0171\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/bluesedumanazaslaovejanegra/img_0174.jpg\" alt=\"img_0174\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/bluesedumanazaslaovejanegra/img_0176.jpg\" alt=\"img_0176\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/bluesedumanazaslaovejanegra/img_0179.jpg\" alt=\"img_0179\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/bluesedumanazaslaovejanegra/img_0182.jpg\" alt=\"img_0182\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/bluesedumanazaslaovejanegra/img_0183.jpg\" alt=\"img_0183\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/bluesedumanazaslaovejanegra/img_0184.jpg\" alt=\"img_0184\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/bluesedumanazaslaovejanegra/img_0186.jpg\" alt=\"img_0186\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/bluesedumanazaslaovejanegra/img_0187.jpg\" alt=\"img_0187\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715